Hi Jonah,

Thanks !!
I want to write hierarchical model including 2 datas, responses (R) and responses times (RT). R and RT are matrix NxQ
In 1st level, each data is modeled with a different model independent
For Responses : the model is Rasch model with parameters theta and betaR
logit(P) = theta - betaR

For Responses Times : the model is lognormal with parameter tau, betaT and sigmaT.
log(RT) ~ Normal(tau - betaT, sigmaT)

